{"id":"2104066965770056085","authorId":"174332143","createdAt":"2026-09-27T04:33:50.000Z","type":"tweet","refId":null,"lang":"en","text":"Tonight, I joined the @azdemparty annual Hall of Fame Dinner to celebrate committed leaders from across our state. And thank you to @JBPritzker for joining us here on the frontlines. \n\nI had the privilege of presenting Rasean Clayton with the Outstanding Labor Leader award. A proud Navy veteran and longtime union organizer, Rasean has made a profound impact on the labor movement in Arizona. \n\n38 days until the midterms. Change only happens from the ground up. So do not sit this moment out. Do not let cynicism win. Let’s fight like hell for the future of our country.","capturedAt":"2026-09-27T05:21:29.337Z","metricsAtCapture":{"likes":7,"retweets":0,"replies":0,"quotes":0},"source":{"version":1,"url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2104066965770056085","textField":"note_tweet.text","raw":{"text":"Tonight, I joined the @azdemparty annual Hall of Fame Dinner to celebrate committed leaders from across our state. And thank you to @JBPritzker for joining us here on the frontlines. \n\nI had the privilege of presenting Rasean Clayton with the Outstanding Labor Leader award. A https://t.co/j35MkiCgEC","note_tweet":{"entities":{"mentions":[{"end":33,"id":"23480020","start":22,"username":"azdemparty"},{"end":143,"id":"45550693","start":132,"username":"JBPritzker"}]},"text":"Tonight, I joined the @azdemparty annual Hall of Fame Dinner to celebrate committed leaders from across our state. And thank you to @JBPritzker for joining us here on the frontlines. \n\nI had the privilege of presenting Rasean Clayton with the Outstanding Labor Leader award. A proud Navy veteran and longtime union organizer, Rasean has made a profound impact on the labor movement in Arizona. \n\n38 days until the midterms. Change only happens from the ground up. So do not sit this moment out. Do not let cynicism win. Let’s fight like hell for the future of our country."